{"version":1,"content":"<p>Anthropic於11月23日宣佈推出Claude Ship，這是一套面向軟件開發流程的AI代理工具，旨在讓AI不僅編寫代碼，還能審查、修復並批准常規代碼變更，從而幫助開發團隊減少代碼合入前的瓶頸。該產品目前以測試版形式推出，面向使用GitHub倉庫的Claude Team和Enterprise計劃用户。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587742.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.423176+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:34:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"71615f6afd74c072d4659641ec4e6d92ca7ba1d23a1e1be0e3944af048a0427b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}